# Requirements → Implementation Pipeline

When editing `docs/requirements/`:

1. Specs (`*.md` except `*.implementation.md`) define WHAT — `{DOMAIN}-R{nn}` rules
2. Implementation docs (`*.implementation.md`) document WHAT EXISTS in `server/`
3. Gap reports: `reports/<feature>-gap-analysis.md`

## Trigger

```
/orchestrate-features
/feature-verifier <feature>
```

## Scope

- Default: **server/** backend (pharmacy ERP + CRM APIs)
- Tenant isolation, GST, batches/FEFO, Rx — not WhatsApp/Meta
- Tests skipped unless user enables Phase 2
